ot/issues/comments/2771699055/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2772855760","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100673#issuecomment-2772855760","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100673","id":2772855760,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lRmvQ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T14:58:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T14:58:14Z","body":"> The tests were using `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS` to instantiate the custom test resources, but that's no longer allowed. I've pushed with a change of that to `GDREGISTER_CLASS`.\r\n\r\nTo make sure I understand correctly: these classes are resource types, right? If so, then this makes sense because I don't think we want anything that uses `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS()` to be loadable from a .tres or .tscn file\r\n\r\nBut I just want to make sure this wasn't a use case were we _do_ want to allow using un-exposed classes. If it is, PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104906 adds a way to do this, but I'm really hoping we don't find any other situations where we want to outside of GDExtension :-)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2772855760/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2772896230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100673#issuecomment-2772896230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100673","id":2772896230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lRwnm","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T15:07:35Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T15:07:35Z","body":"@dsnopek, yes, they are subclasses of `Resource`.\r\n I used `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS` with the idea that it would be the lowest degree of exposure the tes