s `enum::ResourceDeepDuplicateMode`, while it should be `enum::Resource.ResourceDeepDuplicateMode`.\r\n\r\nIt uses\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/401540fe-0876-49ee-b26c-d1270fb0dbc2)\r\n\r\nInstead of, for example\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/479a7137-550e-41a1-8934-6c45ceb06c8c)\r\n\r\nwhich desugars to:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#define BIND_ENUM_CONSTANT(m_constant) \\\r\n    ::ClassDB::bind_integer_constant(get_class_static(), __constant_get_enum_name(m_constant, #m_constant), #m_constant, m_constant);\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/99f5a3d665cfcc517b0b4b55d8668c2116effb69/core/variant/type_info.h#L207-L210\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/99f5a3d665cfcc517b0b4b55d8668c2116effb69/core/object/class_db.cpp#L1111","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2916116489/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]